KZ3 patch 2210 (RSX pass 174): KZ3_DIAG_DELAY=main:N|walk:N (N in ms, default off, diagnostic, never shipped).

A QPC busy-wait of N ms once per frame: main = at the guest thread flip call (gcm_flip_request, the thread that issues the flip; its host
thread id is printed), walk = once per flip on the walker (live-draw flip callback). Prints [diag-delay] at arm and per second (count,
mean injected ms as measured, asked ms). Pure core libs/video/rsx_diag_delay.h, host test tools/smoke/test_diag_delay.sh. Purpose: the
conversion slope dFrame/dDelay (U3). NOT run in the game.

